# syntax=docker/dockerfile:1.7
# Test runner for `make test-docker`: Go (with cgo for -race), Python via uv and Node with pnpm in
# one image, running `make test-go test-py test-web` against the compose.test.yaml services.
ARG GO_IMAGE=golang:1.26.10@sha256:672c944cfd07599b5f1bb179869270cdc94c6254e41db4d431259693cb286b82
ARG NODE_IMAGE=node:22.20.0-slim@sha256:b21fe589dfbe5cc39365d0544b9be3f1f33f55f3c86c87a76ff65a02f8f5848e
ARG UV_IMAGE=ghcr.io/astral-sh/uv:0.11.3@sha256:90bbb3c16635e9627f49eec6539f956d70746c409209041800a0280b93152823

# checkov:skip=CKV_DOCKER_7: the base images are build args whose defaults are version tags, never latest
FROM ${UV_IMAGE} AS uv
FROM ${NODE_IMAGE} AS node

FROM ${GO_IMAGE} AS tests
ARG HTTPS_PROXY
ARG HTTP_PROXY
ARG NO_PROXY
COPY --from=uv /uv /uvx /usr/local/bin/
COPY --from=node /usr/local/bin/node /usr/local/bin/node
COPY --from=node /usr/local/lib/node_modules /usr/local/lib/node_modules
RUN ln -s ../lib/node_modules/npm/bin/npm-cli.js /usr/local/bin/npm \
 && npm install -g --no-fund --no-audit pnpm@10.28.0 \
 && useradd --create-home --uid 10001 tester && mkdir -p /src && chown tester /src
USER 10001
WORKDIR /src
ENV CGO_ENABLED=1 GOTOOLCHAIN=local UV_LINK_MODE=copy UV_PYTHON_INSTALL_DIR=/home/tester/.python \
    PATH=/home/tester/go/bin:/usr/local/go/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin
COPY --chown=10001 go.mod go.sum ./
RUN go mod download
COPY --chown=10001 pyproject.toml uv.lock README.md ./
RUN uv python install 3.12 && uv sync --frozen --no-install-project
COPY --chown=10001 web/package.json web/pnpm-lock.yaml web/
RUN pnpm -C web install --frozen-lockfile
COPY --chown=10001 . .
RUN uv sync --frozen && mkdir -p artifacts/coverage
# A test run, not a server.
HEALTHCHECK NONE
ENTRYPOINT ["make", "test-go", "test-py", "test-web"]
